  "solution": "Given equation:\n\n8 ÷ 2 - 50 × 6 + 16 = 50\n\nChecking for each option, we get\n\n1. + and ÷ → 8 + 2 - 50 × 6 ÷ 16\n\n⇒ 8 + 2 - 50 ×** 6 ÷ ****16**\n\n⇒ 8 + 2 - **50 × 0.375**\n\n⇒ **8 + 2** - 18.75\n\n⇒ **10 - 18.75**\n\n⇒ -8.75 ≠ 50\n\n2. - and + → 8 ÷ 2 + 50 × 6 - 16\n\n⇒ **8 ÷ 2** + 50 × 6 - 16\n\n⇒ 4 + **50 × 6** - 16\n\n⇒ **4 + 300** - 16\n\n⇒ **304 - 16**\n\n⇒ 288 ≠ 50\n\n3. ‘+ and ×’ → 8 ÷ 2 - 50 + 6 × 16\n\n**8 ÷ 2** - 50 + **6 × 16**\n\n⇒ **4** – 50 **+ 96**\n\n⇒ **100 – 50**\n\n⇒ 50 = 50\n\n4. ÷ and × → 8 × 2 - 50 ÷ 6 + 16\n\n⇒ 8 × 2 - **50 ****÷ ****6** + 16\n\n⇒ **8 × ****2** - 8.33 + 16\n\n⇒ **16** - 8.33 **+ 16**\n\n⇒ **32 - 8.33**\n\n⇒ 23.66 ≠ 50.\n\nThus, Option 3 (+ and ×) satisfies the given equation after interchanging the signs.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **‘+ and ×’.**",
